    {
      "id": "3PVI5IFZ",
      "key": "3PVI5IFZ",
      "version": 0,
      "html": "<div data-citation-items=\"%5B%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F19922179%2Fitems%2FBNJGWPZU%22%5D%2C%22itemData%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F19922179%2Fitems%2FBNJGWPZU%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22article%22%2C%22abstract%22%3A%22Robust%20local%20navigation%20in%20unstructured%20and%20dynamic%20environments%20remains%20a%20significant%20challenge%20for%20humanoid%20robots%2C%20requiring%20a%20delicate%20balance%20between%20long-range%20navigation%20targets%20and%20immediate%20motion%20stability.%20In%20this%20paper%2C%20we%20propose%20FocusNav%2C%20a%20spatial%20selective%20attention%20framework%20that%20adaptively%20modulates%20the%20robot%E2%80%99s%20perceptual%20field%20based%20on%20navigational%20intent%20and%20real-time%20stability.%20FocusNav%20features%20a%20Waypoint-Guided%20Spatial%20Cross-Attention%20(WGSCA)%20mechanism%20that%20anchors%20environmental%20feature%20aggregation%20to%20a%20sequence%20of%20predicted%20collision-free%20waypoints%2C%20ensuring%20task-relevant%20perception%20along%20the%20planned%20trajectory.%20To%20enhance%20robustness%20in%20complex%20terrains%2C%20the%20Stability-Aware%20Selective%20Gating%20(SASG)%20module%20autonomously%20truncates%20distal%20information%20when%20detecting%20instability%2C%20compelling%20the%20policy%20to%20prioritize%20immediate%20foothold%20safety.%20Extensive%20experiments%20on%20the%20Unitree%20G1%20humanoid%20robot%20demonstrate%20that%20FocusNav%20significantly%20improves%20navigation%20success%20rates%20in%20challenging%20scenarios%2C%20outperforming%20baselines%20in%20both%20collision%20avoidance%20and%20motion%20stability%2C%20achieving%20robust%20navigation%20in%20dynamic%20and%20complex%20environments.%22%2C%22DOI%22%3A%2210.48550%2FarXiv.2601.12790%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22en%22%2C%22note%22%3A%22arXiv%3A2601.12790%20%5Bcs.RO%5D%22%2C%22number%22%3A%22arXiv%3A2601.12790%22%2C%22publisher%22%3A%22arXiv%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22arXiv.org%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22FocusNav%3A%20Spatial%20Selective%20Attention%20with%20Waypoint%20Guidance%20for%20Humanoid%20Local%20Navigation%22%2C%22title-short%22%3A%22FocusNav%22%2C%22URL%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Farxiv.org%2Fabs%2F2601.12790%22%2C%22author%22%3A%5B%7B%22family%22%3A%22Zhang%22%2C%22given%22%3A%22Yang%22%7D%2C%7B%22family%22%3A%22Ma%22%2C%22given%22%3A%22Jianming%22%7D%2C%7B%22family%22%3A%22Yan%22%2C%22given%22%3A%22Liyun%22%7D%2C%7B%22family%22%3A%22Cao%22%2C%22given%22%3A%22Zhanxiang%22%7D%2C%7B%22family%22%3A%22Zhang%22%2C%22given%22%3A%22Yazhou%22%7D%2C%7B%22family%22%3A%22Li%22%2C%22given%22%3A%22Haoyang%22%7D%2C%7B%22family%22%3A%22Gao%22%2C%22given%22%3A%22Yue%22%7D%5D%2C%22accessed%22%3A%7B%22date-parts%22%3A%5B%5B%222026%22%2C6%2C6%5D%5D%7D%2C%22issued%22%3A%7B%22date-parts%22%3A%5B%5B%222026%22%2C1%2C19%5D%5D%7D%7D%7D%5D\" data-schema-version=\"9\"><p>Key Words: Local navigation in unstructured and dynamic environments, Waypoint-Guided Spatial Cross-Attention Stability-Aware Selective Gating</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>WGSCA + SASG</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>1.Learning Oracle Policy for Waypoint Tracking</p>\n<p>Reward:<img alt=\"\" width=\"709\" height=\"236\" data-attachment-key=\"UN6EGGWS\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" width=\"1313\" height=\"909\" data-attachment-key=\"WWFXC46N\"></p>\n<p>2. FocusNav: Local Navigation with Spatial Selective Attention</p>\n<p>a. multi-modal perception encoder</p>\n<p>(1)sensor simulation: LiDAR + depth camera + BVH</p>\n<p>raycasting:<img alt=\"\" width=\"636\" height=\"73\" data-attachment-key=\"Y9LQ74XN\"><br>(2)cross-modal spatial alignment</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" width=\"631\" height=\"584\" data-attachment-key=\"4L6EZ8FD\"></p>\n<p>compensate the blind point of LiDAR1</p>\n<p>(3)BEV feature extraction - lightweight perception encoder</p>\n<p>b. collision-free waypoint predictor</p>\n<p>(1)backward prediction paradigm</p>\n<p><span class=\"highlight\" data-annotation=\"%7B%22attachmentURI%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F19922179%2Fitems%2F3XKH3WIG%22%2C%22annotationKey%22%3A%22H2UBAZ6W%22%2C%22color%22%3A%22%23ffd400%22%2C%22pageLabel%22%3A%225%22%2C%22position%22%3A%7B%22pageIndex%22%3A4%2C%22rects%22%3A%5B%5B407.614%2C308.162%2C563.031%2C316.8%5D%2C%5B311.973%2C296.207%2C562.461%2C304.845%5D%2C%5B311.973%2C284.252%2C453.292%2C292.89%5D%5D%7D%2C%22citationItem%22%3A%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F19922179%2Fitems%2FBNJGWPZU%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%225%22%7D%7D\">“backward prediction paradigm explicitly generates waypoints starting from the navigation target gn back to the robot’s current position”</span> <span class=\"citation\" data-citation=\"%7B%22citationItems%22%3A%5B%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F19922179%2Fitems%2FBNJGWPZU%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%225%22%7D%5D%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%7D%7D\">(<span class=\"citation-item\">Zhang 等, 2026, p. 5</span>)</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" width=\"641\" height=\"89\" data-attachment-key=\"5GVEQ5YU\"></p>\n<p>(2)autoregressive network with latent consistency - Transformer </p>\n<p>Loss:<img alt=\"\" width=\"678\" height=\"219\" data-attachment-key=\"ZZVPHM63\"></p>\n<p>c. dual-layer spatial selective attention</p>\n<p>(1) Waypoint-guided spatial cross-attention</p>\n<p>waypoints + PE mechanism &nbsp;-&gt; &nbsp;waypoint focused map</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" width=\"673\" height=\"101\" data-attachment-key=\"R35HH2QW\"></p>\n<p>(2) Stability-aware selective gating<br><img alt=\"\" width=\"664\" height=\"100\" data-attachment-key=\"EI3WQBUK\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" width=\"684\" height=\"148\" data-attachment-key=\"E2Y5RYX7\"></p>\n<p>Stability metrics<img alt=\"\" width=\"740\" height=\"411\" data-attachment-key=\"JUQ4CHBB\"></p>\n</div>",
